WEBVTT

00:00:00.390 --> 00:00:02.939
Lolly is a Production Studio

00:00:04.092 --> 00:00:06.588
Crossroads of civilization

00:00:07.734 --> 00:00:09.899
Refuge of all the arts

00:00:11.079 --> 00:00:13.598
Against the ravages of time

00:00:14.766 --> 00:00:16.776
Armoury of fearless truth

00:00:18.022 --> 00:00:19.927
Against whispering rumour

00:00:21.230 --> 00:00:23.628
Incessant trumpet of trade

00:00:24.846 --> 00:00:27.836
From this place ideas may fly abroad

00:00:29.066 --> 00:00:31.881
Not to perish on shores of change

00:00:33.132 --> 00:00:35.808
Not to vary with the writer's hand

00:00:37.074 --> 00:00:38.857
But fixed in time

00:00:40.014 --> 00:00:42.373
Having been verified in proof

00:00:43.586 --> 00:00:46.373
Friend you behold a legacy honoured

00:00:47.615 --> 00:00:50.164
Lolly is a Production Studio
